  "status": "present",
  "value": "sorted arrays of kept starts and ends; coverage at x is (#starts <= x) - (#ends < x), which is non-increasing from the current start, so a binary search over candidate points finds the trimmed start. Complexity target: O(n log n + n * insertion cost) time/O(n) space.",
